  "b50ea3fc-b3a2-403d-9fcf-e041cf99c296"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "gives a random shortest circle about ",
 StyleBox["c", "TI"],
 " in the band {",
 StyleBox["r", "TI"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["s", "TI"],
 "} through all the points ",
 StyleBox["p\:1d62", "TI"],
